              <div class="stk-acts"><span>CANCEL</span><span class="stk-ok">OK</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="sms">
              <div class="sms-from">MPESA<span>now</span></div>
              <p>UJK4X8B2QP Confirmed. Ksh5,000.00 sent to DESERET SACCO for account DS0001 on 20/10/26 at 9:15 AM New M-PESA balance is Ksh12,430.50. Transaction cost, Ksh0.00.</p>
